# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Runtime data written by the file-backed store: website enquiries, chat
# transcripts, and the whole bank when Supabase is not configured. None of it
# belongs in the repository. Anchored to the root: unanchored, "data/" also
# matches src/data/, the site content the build reads, and a fresh clone
# would commit without it.
/data/

